WEBVTT

00:16.997 --> 00:19.297
Lookie, another friend for you.

00:19.547 --> 00:23.437
You all play nice now, until tomorrow.

00:27.707 --> 00:30.677
Um, are you all right?

00:30.677 --> 00:31.797
Yes.

00:32.337 --> 00:34.307
Thank you very much.

00:35.427 --> 00:37.367
Excuse me.

00:43.347 --> 00:44.697
Let's see.

00:51.687 --> 00:53.957
Come on, let's go.

00:56.387 --> 00:57.527
Okay...

01:06.977 --> 01:09.347
Please wait here a bit.

01:11.727 --> 01:13.157
Good evening.

01:13.157 --> 01:14.517
Y-You're...!

01:14.517 --> 01:15.217
Argh!

01:15.217 --> 01:16.977
How dare you?!

01:17.117 --> 01:18.987
Gahh!

01:21.657 --> 01:23.487
Thank you for waiting.

01:24.337 --> 01:25.957
Now, let's go.

01:25.957 --> 01:27.497
Y-Yes...

01:31.687 --> 01:33.237
What's this?

01:33.237 --> 01:35.237
Where do you think you're going?

01:37.097 --> 01:39.997
I don't know how you got out, but—

01:52.067 --> 01:53.507
Sorry for that.

01:53.767 --> 01:55.447
You're safe now.

02:11.437 --> 02:13.037
We were so scared!

02:13.037 --> 02:14.257
Thank you!

02:14.257 --> 02:16.527
Thank you so much!

02:16.767 --> 02:18.737
Thank you so much!

02:18.737 --> 02:20.037
Thank you!

02:21.387 --> 02:24.307
Please calm yourself, Princess Olivia.

02:25.037 --> 02:27.547
How do... you know my name?

02:27.877 --> 02:29.827
I'm so glad you're safe.

02:29.827 --> 02:32.237
Olivia Arnold, the second 
in line to the throne.

02:33.727 --> 02:36.297
Um, you are...

02:36.297 --> 02:39.317
I'm an Astral of the Arnold Army.

02:39.317 --> 02:40.897
My name is Lily.

02:45.197 --> 02:50.097
<i>That was when Ray and I first met.</i>

03:03.747 --> 03:06.287
I need more Ray in my life.

03:34.117 --> 03:35.637
Good morning, Ray.

03:35.637 --> 03:36.747
Good morning, Elisa.

03:36.747 --> 03:38.687
Everything all right?

03:38.687 --> 03:41.697
Yes. You just seem different than usual.

03:41.697 --> 03:42.847
Oh really?

03:42.847 --> 03:45.437
But the same goes for you.

03:45.437 --> 03:46.377
You think so?

03:49.497 --> 03:53.627
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

03:54.217 --> 03:58.007
<b>Episode 01
The Boy Who Is the World's Strongest Sorcerer
Participates in a Large Scale Magic Battle Tournament</b>

04:05.857 --> 04:07.957
Regarding the other day's incident.

04:07.957 --> 04:11.427
You're saying Evan Bernstein acted alone?

04:11.427 --> 04:15.127
There's been no movement from 
Eugenics' main forces until now,

04:15.127 --> 04:17.087
so that is a fair assumption.

04:17.087 --> 04:21.227
And Paratrogo, who aided him, is safely 
locked away in a special prison.

04:21.877 --> 04:23.337
Evan is...

04:23.707 --> 04:25.927
...dead.

04:26.697 --> 04:30.217
The Hale clan took care of the aftermath.

04:32.007 --> 04:35.707
By the way, Lydia, how is he doing?

04:36.497 --> 04:37.687
Oh, him?

04:37.687 --> 04:39.297
He's doing well.

04:39.297 --> 04:41.727
He has his school life and his friends.

04:42.607 --> 04:47.857
I think that environment is a 
good influence on him right now.

04:48.787 --> 04:53.257
It might happen sooner 
than I anticipated.

04:54.667 --> 04:56.177
Hey, did you hear?

04:56.177 --> 04:57.487
You mean that thing?

04:57.487 --> 04:59.607
If it's about White, then...

04:59.607 --> 05:00.577
What?!

05:01.327 --> 05:04.287
No! I'm talking about the Magicks War!

05:01.327 --> 05:04.947
Thing... thing...

05:04.947 --> 05:10.507
Oh, the completely new team battle that
doesn't limit anything to school or year?

05:10.747 --> 05:13.697
I heard it will take place 
before the choir event.

05:13.997 --> 05:15.897
White's thing...

05:15.897 --> 05:16.857
Seriously.

05:17.707 --> 05:20.267
It's three people per team, right?

05:20.267 --> 05:22.507
I bet Al wants to enter, right?

05:22.507 --> 05:27.657
Yeah, but if it's Wisel and me, 
we'd only get in Al's way, right?

05:27.887 --> 05:32.767
You do realize that would mean
you'd be eliminated instantly, right?

05:32.767 --> 05:34.027
Right?

05:34.027 --> 05:38.277
The reason he's been going somewhere 
with Evi lately is...

05:40.087 --> 05:42.567
These two broad-chested guys...

05:42.567 --> 05:43.457
Hustle!

05:43.457 --> 05:44.527
Muscle!

05:45.487 --> 05:46.787
Hey.

05:47.387 --> 05:50.287
So what'll happen, I wonder?

05:50.287 --> 05:53.837
I mean Amelia is the new 
champion of Magic Chevalier.

05:55.147 --> 05:57.997
I don't think she's too interested.

05:57.997 --> 05:59.667
I guess that makes sense.

05:59.667 --> 06:02.557
She probably has no reason 
to enter the competition.

06:02.557 --> 06:03.887
Right.

06:10.947 --> 06:12.997
My feelings...

06:13.527 --> 06:18.847
I started reading this love story by 
Luna Ether because Ray was reading it...

06:20.057 --> 06:23.327
I would've never expected it 
to pierce my soul like this.

06:23.327 --> 06:24.197
Oh...

06:24.197 --> 06:25.257
La sta—

06:27.547 --> 06:29.017
Who's there?

06:29.017 --> 06:33.577
Amelia, I'd like you to compete 
in the "Magicks War" with me.

06:33.977 --> 06:36.397
Amelia, please open up.

06:36.397 --> 06:37.577
Amelia?!

06:37.927 --> 06:39.467
Coming.

06:39.467 --> 06:44.197
Amelia, will you enter 
the Magicks War with... us?

06:53.207 --> 06:55.237
It's probably that thing, right?

06:56.347 --> 06:57.607
Indeed!

06:58.737 --> 07:00.587
What about you, Ray?

07:00.587 --> 07:04.117
I'm going to talk to my master 
about it, but I would like to enter.

07:04.907 --> 07:06.367
You in good form?

07:06.367 --> 07:09.747
It's just my personal opinion, 
but it's not bad.

07:09.747 --> 07:10.857
I see.

07:12.667 --> 07:16.117
Um, is something wrong with you, Ray?

07:16.947 --> 07:20.457
Hey, if we're going to be a team,

07:20.457 --> 07:23.487
shouldn't you properly explain 
what's going on to Ariane?

07:23.487 --> 07:25.007
You're right.

07:25.007 --> 07:27.537
I should give her a proper explanation.

07:27.987 --> 07:29.877
What are you talking about?

07:29.877 --> 07:34.397
Ariane, I am the Iceblade Sorcerer.

07:36.097 --> 07:36.967
Huh?

07:37.507 --> 07:39.417
Please hold on a moment.

07:39.417 --> 07:43.927
I'm sure I must have misheard that, 
so could you please repeat that?

07:44.587 --> 07:46.917
I am one of the seven grand sorcerers,

07:47.417 --> 07:49.287
the Iceblade Sorcerer.

07:50.937 --> 07:52.037
Amelia?!

07:53.137 --> 07:54.207
Yes.

07:54.207 --> 07:56.287
How long have you known?

07:56.287 --> 08:01.157
Since before the Magic Chevalier, I guess.

08:02.577 --> 08:03.817
Unfair.

08:04.807 --> 08:06.277
That's so unfair!

08:06.797 --> 08:10.097
I'd heard that you two 
were training together.

08:10.097 --> 08:13.097
But I never understood why 
you were training with Ray.

08:13.097 --> 08:15.797
It always bothered me!

08:16.047 --> 08:18.557
So that's what was going on!

08:18.887 --> 08:20.657
I'll say it again...

08:21.437 --> 08:22.687
That's so unfair!

08:22.687 --> 08:24.567
You got one-on-one training!

08:24.567 --> 08:26.857
From such an amazing person!

08:27.697 --> 08:31.817
Um, well, I'm sorry.

08:33.197 --> 08:36.317
Ariane, so you believe me?

08:37.887 --> 08:40.697
It certainly explains a lot of mysteries.

08:40.697 --> 08:42.327
Ariane...

08:42.517 --> 08:44.597
So... yes.

08:45.677 --> 08:49.197
Then let's talk about 
the past a little bit.

08:51.197 --> 08:53.757
Hey, hey, so what are 
you doing after this?

08:53.757 --> 08:54.867
Want to go get a drink?

08:54.867 --> 08:57.477
Why not? What about you, Lydia?

08:57.477 --> 08:59.627
Guess it can't hurt, once in a while.

08:59.627 --> 09:00.847
What do you say, Carla?

09:00.847 --> 09:03.047
Yes, I'll join.

09:03.047 --> 09:04.537
Lydia-senpai.

09:05.477 --> 09:07.237
I need to talk to you.

09:07.237 --> 09:09.147
That means you're coming too, then!

09:09.147 --> 09:10.227
I'm sorry?

09:15.107 --> 09:18.517
And that's how I'm here, now.

09:21.477 --> 09:23.627
How horrible!

09:24.667 --> 09:29.597
The Far East War was the first war where 
magic was used in real battles...

09:29.597 --> 09:32.977
I heard that it was the 
worst war of all time.

09:33.567 --> 09:37.237
And you were at the front lines 
there from such a young age...

09:40.377 --> 09:43.837
But that's where I met my 
master and the others.

09:43.837 --> 09:45.767
And now I'm here.

09:45.767 --> 09:50.027
So is that the master who gave you the 
title of Iceblade after the war ended?

09:50.027 --> 09:51.107
Yes.

09:51.107 --> 09:54.887
Overheating means I still 
can't release its full power,

09:55.357 --> 09:58.087
but I did inherit the name 
and station from my master.

09:59.987 --> 10:01.027
Ray...

10:03.547 --> 10:05.037
I challenge you!

10:05.037 --> 10:06.857
Wait, what?

10:06.857 --> 10:08.517
Why are you doing this?

10:08.517 --> 10:11.797
Amelia, this is my fate as a maiden!

10:11.797 --> 10:14.297
Your fate as a what now?

10:16.787 --> 10:17.917
What are the terms?

10:17.917 --> 10:20.697
Whoever says "I yield," loses.

10:21.117 --> 10:22.447
Understood.

10:23.407 --> 10:25.557
We haven't had a chance since last time.

10:25.827 --> 10:26.867
That's true.

10:26.867 --> 10:27.697
Well...

10:27.697 --> 10:30.197
things were a bit different then.

10:31.027 --> 10:33.687
Amelia, will you be the referee?

10:33.967 --> 10:34.997
Okay.

10:34.997 --> 10:36.697
Are you sure about this though?

10:36.697 --> 10:39.947
You ended up using your powers 
with Rebecca-senpai, too.

10:41.217 --> 10:42.277
Yes.

10:42.277 --> 10:44.607
But this time, I won't use them.

10:44.607 --> 10:47.097
And you think you can
beat Ariane like that?

10:47.097 --> 10:49.827
Well, I will try.

10:50.167 --> 10:52.837
Then, let's begin!

10:52.837 --> 10:54.087
Ogre!

11:07.887 --> 11:10.617
I... yield.

11:11.667 --> 11:13.927
Did you use some kind of special magic?

11:13.927 --> 11:14.957
No.

11:14.957 --> 11:17.657
Just an inside code 
to enhance my body.

11:17.987 --> 11:19.517
You must be lying!

11:19.517 --> 11:23.307
There's no way you could defeat 
my Ogre with just an inside code!

11:23.737 --> 11:26.247
There are no lies here.

11:28.047 --> 11:30.997
So this this is the power of 
one of the grand seven...

11:31.317 --> 11:33.507
Even when you're not at 
your full strength,

11:33.507 --> 11:35.847
you completely overwhelmed me.

11:35.847 --> 11:36.957
Ariane.

11:37.587 --> 11:41.837
This victory was only possible because 
I spotted your weakness.

11:41.837 --> 11:43.507
My weakness?

11:43.507 --> 11:46.017
You have lots of potential to improve!

11:47.007 --> 11:50.147
Ariane, do you want to get stronger?

11:51.747 --> 11:53.317
Of course!

11:53.317 --> 11:54.777
That's the spirit.

11:54.957 --> 11:56.707
Well then, Ariane Algren!

11:57.197 --> 12:01.277
I'll assign you an Ainsworth-style 
bootcamp special regimen!

12:01.277 --> 12:03.277
That sounds excellent!

12:03.277 --> 12:05.187
Th-This can't be real!

12:05.187 --> 12:07.987
B-But since I finished it, 
I'm fine, right?!

12:07.987 --> 12:09.507
I've already got my ranger badge.

12:09.507 --> 12:11.367
It's just for Ariane, right?!

12:11.367 --> 12:12.257
Yeah.

12:13.297 --> 12:14.287
However!

12:14.287 --> 12:16.307
I'll assign you a separate 
training course!

12:16.307 --> 12:17.417
Wha?!

12:17.417 --> 12:20.967
For you, engaging with magic is more 
pertinent than training your body.

12:21.407 --> 12:25.567
Listen up! For the Magicks War, 
we need to strengthen your body first!

12:25.567 --> 12:28.057
And there's only one important thing!

12:28.057 --> 12:29.807
Your answer is "ranger!"

12:29.807 --> 12:32.847
Do you understand, trainee Amelia?!

12:32.847 --> 12:34.817
Ranger, I say!

12:34.817 --> 12:35.817
Ranger!

12:35.817 --> 12:37.577
Training will commence 
immediately tomorrow!

12:37.577 --> 12:38.707
Do you understand?

12:38.707 --> 12:39.767
Ranger!

12:39.767 --> 12:40.357
I say!

12:40.357 --> 12:41.197
Again!

12:41.197 --> 12:42.487
Ranger!

12:42.487 --> 12:45.457
I mean, nooo!

12:52.907 --> 12:55.357
Good morning, Ray.

12:56.567 --> 12:58.597
Good morning, senpai.

12:58.597 --> 13:00.477
You're out early again.

13:00.477 --> 13:03.867
Because today's the day 
we have our shift together.

13:03.867 --> 13:05.497
How are you doing?

13:05.857 --> 13:08.787
I'm doing well, thanks to you.

13:08.787 --> 13:11.097
And I can use magic 
without problems, too.

13:11.347 --> 13:12.877
I'm very happy to hear that.

13:12.877 --> 13:17.787
It's all thanks to the 
spell you cast on me.

13:21.217 --> 13:22.457
That reminds me.

13:22.457 --> 13:25.037
I heard you are participating 
in the Magicks War.

13:25.037 --> 13:25.947
Yes.

13:26.257 --> 13:28.847
I am going to form a team 
with Amelia and Ariane.

13:31.207 --> 13:32.917
Is something wrong?

13:32.917 --> 13:35.537
You're surrounded by only women.

13:35.537 --> 13:36.817
Really?

13:36.817 --> 13:38.277
There are Evi and Albert,

13:38.277 --> 13:40.747
and all the guys from the 
Environmental Research Club.

13:41.177 --> 13:43.727
Sure, but...

13:44.047 --> 13:46.447
I'd like to be with you too.

13:46.447 --> 13:48.427
You shouldn't push yourself right now.

13:48.987 --> 13:51.477
I worry about you.

13:51.477 --> 13:53.987
You do?

13:54.487 --> 13:55.707
Yes.

13:55.707 --> 13:57.977
I'm always thinking about you.

13:57.977 --> 13:59.477
<i>Ba-boom!</i>

13:59.477 --> 14:01.487
Oh, come on now.

14:01.487 --> 14:04.937
Ray, you're so...

14:04.937 --> 14:05.997
Seriously...

14:07.337 --> 14:08.597
Ray...

14:08.597 --> 14:09.787
Senpai?

14:09.787 --> 14:10.997
Ray!

14:10.997 --> 14:12.227
Amelia.

14:12.227 --> 14:14.127
I figured I'd find you here.

14:12.607 --> 14:13.627
Grr.

14:14.127 --> 14:17.037
I wanted to ask you something 
about my training.

14:17.037 --> 14:18.127
Got it.

14:18.127 --> 14:19.597
I'll meet you in the classroom, 
once I'm done here.

14:19.597 --> 14:21.027
All right, thank you.

14:21.027 --> 14:22.157
Ahem!

14:22.997 --> 14:25.637
Good morning, Amelia.

14:25.067 --> 14:26.507
Kinokon!

14:26.507 --> 14:29.487
Good morning, Rebecca-senpai.

14:28.867 --> 14:30.877
Takepoko, takepoko.

14:30.497 --> 14:33.397
I'll send Ray over

14:33.397 --> 14:37.737
after the "two of us" 
enjoy breakfast "alone."

14:36.067 --> 14:38.647
I want curry!

14:38.647 --> 14:41.647
Is that an abuse of your station?

14:39.297 --> 14:41.357
They have hayashi rice, too!

14:41.647 --> 14:43.137
As the president of the club?

14:43.137 --> 14:44.197
Or...

14:44.197 --> 14:46.397
As the president of the student council?

14:46.397 --> 14:49.907
Oh no, no such thing is happening.

14:49.617 --> 14:52.417
Takepoko, takepoko.

14:49.907 --> 14:50.847
Kinokon!

14:53.037 --> 14:54.897
<i>What's all this pressure?</i>

14:54.897 --> 14:57.177
<i>And these strange animals?</i>

14:57.377 --> 14:58.607
One moment.

15:02.327 --> 15:03.897
What is this?!

15:03.897 --> 15:05.267
Amelia.

15:05.267 --> 15:06.167
Yes?

15:06.787 --> 15:08.597
Can we make a deal?

15:09.117 --> 15:11.677
A deal...?

15:11.677 --> 15:13.697
I'm worried!

15:13.947 --> 15:16.137
About?

15:16.137 --> 15:17.517
About Ariane.

15:17.517 --> 15:18.697
How so?

15:18.697 --> 15:24.197
Her training would have her be 
with Ray all day long... alone.

15:24.197 --> 15:26.197
I suppose that's true, yes.

15:26.197 --> 15:27.707
That's dangerous!

15:27.707 --> 15:29.707
I'm sure she also thinks of Ray as...

15:29.707 --> 15:30.957
N-No way!

15:30.957 --> 15:32.407
I don't think...

15:31.497 --> 15:34.457
Put your hand on your 
heart and think about it!

15:34.457 --> 15:36.567
I'm certain you know 
what I'm talking about!

15:38.777 --> 15:41.477
I want to keep living, next to you.

15:41.477 --> 15:42.287
Amelia!

15:42.287 --> 15:43.467
Get up!

15:43.467 --> 15:44.417
Want a bite?

15:45.257 --> 15:46.297
So, what do you say?

15:46.297 --> 15:48.717
But I mean, still...

15:48.717 --> 15:51.287
He's oblivious to the fact 
that he's a total charmer.

15:51.287 --> 15:54.467
We can't afford another rival 
who's smitten with him.

15:55.137 --> 15:57.227
Don't you agree?

16:04.237 --> 16:04.987
Ray!

16:04.987 --> 16:07.597
You got invited by Ariane, right?

16:07.597 --> 16:08.597
Yeah.

16:09.247 --> 16:13.237
Thinking about it,
you and her have a good vibe.

16:13.237 --> 16:14.597
Personality-wise.

16:14.597 --> 16:16.507
Does that mean you know her well?

16:16.507 --> 16:19.257
I mean, we've met at noble parties.

16:19.257 --> 16:20.637
How should I put it?

16:20.637 --> 16:22.747
She's pretty enthusiastic!

16:22.747 --> 16:25.227
True, she's passionate.

16:25.227 --> 16:26.937
I mean, her soul.

16:26.937 --> 16:28.847
I see.

16:28.847 --> 16:31.257
I get the same feeling.

16:31.257 --> 16:33.337
That makes sense then.

16:37.327 --> 16:38.897
Excuse me.

16:39.597 --> 16:42.227
Come right in, Amelia.

16:48.627 --> 16:50.347
Rebecca.

16:51.287 --> 16:55.767
So we're entering a non-aggression treaty 
for the duration of the tournament, I see.

16:59.697 --> 17:01.107
What's going on?

17:01.107 --> 17:02.067
Dina.

17:02.067 --> 17:03.047
Y-Yes.

17:03.607 --> 17:05.207
May I ask you a favor?

17:06.177 --> 17:07.547
Yes...

17:10.017 --> 17:11.427
We've been waiting for you.

17:11.427 --> 17:12.637
Evi.

17:12.637 --> 17:14.087
Albert, you're here too.

17:14.087 --> 17:17.247
We heard you formed a team 
with Amelia and Lady Ariane?

17:17.247 --> 17:18.127
Yeah.

17:18.827 --> 17:21.177
I wouldn't have minded 
being on a team with you.

17:21.407 --> 17:22.737
Sorry.

17:22.737 --> 17:24.357
No, we're actually thrilled.

17:24.357 --> 17:27.207
We want to see what fighting you is like.

17:27.207 --> 17:28.697
So you two...

17:28.907 --> 17:31.547
Yeah, we formed a team.

17:31.547 --> 17:33.447
From now on, we'll be rivals.

17:33.717 --> 17:35.677
Teams have three people on them.

17:35.677 --> 17:36.947
So who is your third?

17:37.727 --> 17:39.277
That's a good question.

17:39.277 --> 17:41.027
We don't have anyone yet...

17:42.067 --> 17:43.707
But we know who we want.

17:43.707 --> 17:45.127
I see.

17:45.507 --> 17:46.917
Good luck to us all!

17:47.347 --> 17:48.257
Yeah.

17:50.817 --> 17:52.457
To all of us.

17:53.547 --> 17:56.677
Oh, Ray! Did you get even taller?

17:56.677 --> 17:58.217
I didn't, Master.

17:58.507 --> 18:00.217
I see, I see.

18:00.217 --> 18:01.577
So, what's up?

18:01.577 --> 18:03.227
Right. So actually...

18:03.467 --> 18:05.227
This is about the Magicks War.

18:05.227 --> 18:06.987
Fast as always.

18:08.097 --> 18:09.447
Why not?

18:09.447 --> 18:11.887
Your overheating's gotten 
pretty good right?

18:11.887 --> 18:13.737
Yes. So then...

18:14.027 --> 18:16.547
You're free to do as you please.

18:17.847 --> 18:19.127
By the way...

18:20.537 --> 18:21.617
Hello.

18:21.617 --> 18:24.627
Ray White, it's been a while.

18:25.457 --> 18:27.087
Lieselotte.

18:27.627 --> 18:29.877
I was just wanting to speak with you.

18:30.117 --> 18:33.327
I was just asking Lydia for advice.

18:33.917 --> 18:35.887
More like forcing me to give it.

18:35.297 --> 18:36.867
Then it's perfect timing.

18:36.867 --> 18:39.407
Hey, don't ignore me.

18:37.637 --> 18:40.047
Because I had something I wanted 
to discuss with you, too.

18:45.617 --> 18:47.777
A good morning to you, Amelia.

18:48.507 --> 18:50.287
Good morning, Ariane.

18:52.527 --> 18:54.157
Is something wrong?

18:54.157 --> 18:57.937
Oh, nothing's wrong...

18:57.937 --> 18:59.657
Good morning, Amelia and Ariane!

19:01.647 --> 19:02.917
<i>He's here!</i>

19:02.917 --> 19:05.077
Good morning, Ray.

19:05.917 --> 19:08.597
That... is you, right?

19:08.917 --> 19:10.087
Phew...

19:10.087 --> 19:10.997
All right!

19:11.667 --> 19:13.937
We're going to start with 
a 20-kilometer run.

19:13.937 --> 19:15.437
Are you ready?

19:15.437 --> 19:17.047
Ranger! I say!

19:17.047 --> 19:18.877
So that part's unchanged.

19:18.877 --> 19:20.627
Trainee Amelia, what was that?

19:21.577 --> 19:25.197
R-Ranger!

19:25.437 --> 19:27.197
Ranger!

19:27.197 --> 19:29.197
Ranger!

19:29.197 --> 19:31.197
Rangfrrgb!

19:33.707 --> 19:37.467
So this is the Ainsworth-style bootcamp.

19:38.177 --> 19:40.797
Why do I have to do this too?

19:40.797 --> 19:43.717
This was a demonstration before 
we start our real training.

19:44.697 --> 19:48.067
Trainee Amelia, starting next week,

19:48.067 --> 19:50.217
you'll be on a special two-week 
training program.

19:52.317 --> 19:53.577
What's this?

19:53.577 --> 19:55.237
You'll find out when you get there.

19:55.237 --> 19:57.217
If you make it back alive,

19:57.217 --> 20:01.157
your magical abilities will increase 
to an even higher level.

20:01.157 --> 20:04.837
Trainee Ariane, you will sleep 
and train at my house back home.

20:04.837 --> 20:06.617
Ranger, I say!

20:07.767 --> 20:09.347
Now just one minute!

20:09.347 --> 20:10.397
What is it?

20:10.397 --> 20:12.817
I'm coming to your house too!

20:12.817 --> 20:15.357
No, what you need to train 
is your magical skills.

20:15.357 --> 20:18.617
Besides, we will only be doing 
physical training non-stop.

20:19.977 --> 20:21.157
Ariane!

20:21.157 --> 20:21.857
Yes?

20:21.857 --> 20:22.847
Over here!

20:23.237 --> 20:24.997
Ray, you stay there!

20:24.997 --> 20:27.957
Please be gentle.

20:30.007 --> 20:33.087
Up, up, down, down, left, 
right, left, right, B.

20:33.847 --> 20:37.257
Ray. I'll accept it for now.

20:37.257 --> 20:38.537
All right.

20:38.537 --> 20:39.977
Good to hear.

20:39.977 --> 20:41.657
So, what were you two talking about?

20:44.117 --> 20:46.157
Don't you worry about that!

20:45.217 --> 20:46.647
Right, right.

20:49.987 --> 20:52.387
I definitely need to keep an eye on this.

20:53.717 --> 20:55.407
What did you say?

20:55.737 --> 20:58.047
Starting this weekend, it seems.

21:00.037 --> 21:01.947
I can't believe this.

21:01.947 --> 21:03.777
He really has no self-awareness.

21:04.397 --> 21:06.537
I hope nothing happens.

21:06.537 --> 21:08.357
I think something might.

21:20.177 --> 21:22.387
So you're saying it's 
in the back of this?

21:22.387 --> 21:23.627
Let's go.

21:27.757 --> 21:28.837
You're here.

21:31.407 --> 21:33.187
I'm sorry for keeping you waiting.

21:34.767 --> 21:36.707
Let's go, Ariane!

21:37.447 --> 21:38.947
Yes, I say!

21:43.947 --> 21:46.627
Once we leave this place 
behind, it'll be right there.

21:47.777 --> 21:49.697
Yes, I say!

21:51.957 --> 21:53.957
Ray, what's wrong?

22:06.077 --> 22:07.477
Pow!

22:07.477 --> 22:08.767
Ray!

22:12.177 --> 22:13.477
A girl?!

22:13.477 --> 22:15.377
I missed you, Stella!

22:15.377 --> 22:17.037
You've grown again.

22:17.657 --> 22:19.487
Just a little.

22:19.727 --> 22:20.907
What about you, Big Brother?

22:20.907 --> 22:22.787
I'm the same as always.

22:22.787 --> 22:24.247
"Big Brother?!"

22:24.247 --> 22:26.427
Ariane, let me introduce you.

22:26.867 --> 22:28.617
I'm Stella White.

22:28.617 --> 22:30.697
I'm my big brother's little sister.

22:30.697 --> 22:32.257
Big brother!?

22:32.527 --> 22:34.367
Little sister?!

23:48.867 --> 23:49.637
I'm Rebecca.

23:48.877 --> 23:52.127
<b>~ Next Episode Preview ~</b>

23:48.877 --> 23:52.127
<b>~ Next Episode Preview ~</b>

23:49.637 --> 23:50.427
I'm Amelia.

23:50.427 --> 23:51.237
I'm Dina.

23:51.237 --> 23:52.117
This is the preview.

23:52.117 --> 23:53.917
The Magicks War is coming up.

23:53.917 --> 23:55.537
Everybody is training on their own.

23:55.537 --> 23:57.277
In some deep deep forest!

23:57.277 --> 23:58.877
In some deep deep forest!

23:58.877 --> 24:00.747
That person shows up again!

24:00.747 --> 24:02.417
I can't believe it!

24:02.417 --> 24:05.237
Next time on <i>The Iceblade 
Sorcerer Shall Rule the World!</i>

24:05.237 --> 24:06.727
Two!

24:07.177 --> 24:09.297
Episode 2 will be full of training and...

24:09.267 --> 24:09.307
<b>The Iceblade <b>Sorcerer
</b>Shall <b>Rule </b>the <b>World</b></b>

24:09.297 --> 24:12.727
"The Boy Who Is the World's 
Strongest Sorcerer Dons a Mask."

24:09.307 --> 24:15.137
<b>Episode 02
The Boy Who Is the
World's Strongest Sorcerer Dons a Mask</b>

24:12.727 --> 24:13.887
Again?!
